    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="28.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:LeisWl">Leis Wl</ref> 28.1</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="xno" source="#robertson" n="28.1" corresp="#wit-hk">E si li guardireve averad XXX hides, quite serrad pur sun travail.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-hk">And even if the Commander of the Watch has 30 hides, his duty shall grant him exemption in this matter.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="513"><ref target="clause:Rect_18-to-18-1">Rect 18</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">*vgl. Rect. 18</note>
        <note type="editorial">Added October 2026 from Robertson pp. 266–267 (text and translation); Liebermann’s text (K–M) not yet added</note>
      </div>
